@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:亚里沙为什么会选择<br>自寻短见？|#0104Trial09_Margo003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal2,ArmR8_2,ArmL7,Eyes2_Normal_Open2,Mouth2_Fearful_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……目前能明确的是，<br>亚里沙一直以来<br>都需要安眠药<br>来辅助睡眠。|#0104Trial09_Meruru001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal2,ArmR8_2,ArmL7,Eyes2_Normal_Open2,Mouth2_Fearful_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:所以我想，<br>她一直很苦恼，<br>苦恼得<br>夜不能寐……|#0104Trial09_Meruru002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:长时间待在<br>这种鬼地方，<br>换谁都会疯好不好！|#0104Trial09_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR5,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"<link=\"Objection_01_04_09_01\">饭菜</link>难吃，<br><link=\"Objection_01_04_09_02\">房间</link>也阴森森脏兮兮的！<br>……话说回来，哪里会有人<br>受到这种<link=\"Objection_01_04_09_03\">监禁</link><br>还能保持正常啊！|#0104Trial09_Coco002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Uncomfortable_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:可是……<br>应该是有什么契机<br>导致亚里沙<br>想要自杀的吧？|#0104Trial09_Margo004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Uncomfortable_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:换一个角度来看，<br>也可以这么说——<br>这个契机就是<br>【杀害亚里沙的凶手】……<br>|#0104Trial09_Margo005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR6,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Uncomfortable_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……你是说，<br>如果有人教唆<br>亚里沙自杀，<br>那我们就应该投票给那个人？|#0104Trial09_Coco003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR5,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我觉得<br>投票给那个人<br>也没问题。|#0104Trial09_Margo006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR5,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"我们正在进行的是<br>【<link=\"Objection_01_04_09_04\">魔女审判</link>】……<br>和外部世界的<link=\"Objection_01_04_09_05\">法庭</link>本质就不一样。|#0104Trial09_Margo007|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4


